### Local - Delete a contact
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}

### Production - Delete a contact
DELETE {{productionUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}

### Local - Invalid contact data
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "D",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "favoriteColor": "",
  "birthday": "not-a-date"
}

### Local - Invalid MongoDB ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/not-a-valid-id

### Local - Valid ID that does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/64b123456789012345678901